root=Column([Heading("Choose a plan for your team",level:1),Grid([Card([Stat("Monthly price",19,format:"currency"),Facts([{label:"Members",value:"5"},{label:"Storage",value:"20 GB"}]),Button("Choose Starter",on_click:say("Choose the Starter plan"))],title:"Starter"),Card([Badge("Recommended",tone:"success"),Stat("Monthly price",49,format:"currency"),Facts([{label:"Members",value:"25"},{label:"Storage",value:"100 GB"}]),Button("Choose Team",tone:"primary",on_click:say("Choose the Team plan"))],title:"Team"),Card([Stat("Monthly price","Contact sales"),Facts([{label:"Members",value:"Unlimited"},{label:"Storage",value:"Custom"}]),Button("Contact sales",on_click:say("Contact sales about Enterprise"))],title:"Enterprise")],cols:3)])
